msgctxt "128_Akiyama"
msgid "Hi! I'm a scout for a hostess club. Do you have a second?"
msgstr "¡Mucho gusto! soy ojeador de un club de hostess. ¿Tienes un momento?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "140_Girl du Jour"
msgid "Huh? Why would you want to talk to me?"
msgstr "¿Eh? ¿Por qué quiere hablar conmigo?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:translated_by=Bas
msgctxt "152_Akiyama"
msgid "You kind of looked like you needed money."
msgstr "Pareces que te hace falta un poco de dinero."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:translated_by=Bas
msgctxt "164_Girl du Jour"
msgid "You jerk! Mind your own business!"
msgstr "¡Imbécil! ¡Preocúpate por lo tuyo!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:translated_by=Bas
msgctxt "176_Akiyama"
msgid "Sorry! I was just kidding..."
msgstr "¡Lo siento! Solo bromeaba..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "188_Girl du Jour"
msgid "Hmph! Leave me alone!"
msgstr "¡Ugh! ¡Déjame en paz!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "200_Akiyama"
msgid "Sorry..."
msgstr "Lo siento..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Keiner
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "248_Akiyama"
msgid "Because you're cute! Got to be cute if you want to be a\\r\nhostess."
msgstr "¡Porque eres un encanto! Eres perfecta para\nser hostess."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "260_Girl du Jour"
msgid "Oh, uh, I see..."
msgstr "Oh, um, ya veo..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:translated_by=Bas
msgctxt "272_Akiyama"
msgid "That's right! So what do you think? It's not easy work, but\\r\nit's good work if you give it your all."
msgstr "¡Así es! ¿Qué opinas? No es un trabajo fácil, pero es un buen trabajo si lo das todo."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "284_Girl du Jour"
msgid "Hmm... Could you maybe tell me more?"
msgstr "Oh... ¿Le importaría contarme más al respecto?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:translated_by=Bas
msgctxt "296_Akiyama"
msgid "Of course! Just leave me your cell number, and I'll be in\\r\ntouch."
msgstr "¡No hay problema! Solo dame tu número de teléfono y\nme pondré en contacto contigo."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "308_Girl du Jour"
msgid "Okay, sure. And thank you."
msgstr "Me parece bien, yo encantada."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:translated_by=Bas
msgctxt "332_Akiyama"
msgid "Talk to you later!"
msgstr "¡Te hablo luego!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:translated_by=Bas
msgctxt "380_Akiyama"
msgid "You looked like you needed money."
msgstr "Parecía que te necesitabas dinero."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:translated_by=Bas
msgctxt "392_Akiyama"
msgid "You're cute."
msgstr "Porque eres muy linda."

